3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Barky Balboa</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bork Laser</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chew-barka</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n52:[\"$\",\"p\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Joan Jett</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Twain</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n54:[\"$\",\"p\",\"78\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Hercule Poirot</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n55:[\"$\",\"p\",\"79\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pawdrey Plaza</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n56:[\"$\",\"p\",\"80\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Woof Blitzer</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",\"81\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Big Purr</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n58:[\"$\",\"p\",\"82\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Stevie Nicks</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n59:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"83\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"71–75\"]}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pupperoni</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Buzz Aldrin</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Taylor Swift</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"87\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Typhoon</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"88\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Cat Sajak</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 75 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n60:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n61:[\"$\",\"p\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n62:[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n63:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n64:[\"$\",\"p\",\"94\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n65:[\"$\",\"p\",\"95\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n66:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"96\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n67:[\"$\",\"p\",\"97\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",\"98\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",\"99\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"100\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"101\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"102\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/chattering-lory/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Chattering Lory\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"106\",{\"href\":\"/animal/khao-manee/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Khao Manee\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"126\",{\"href\":\"/animal/scottish-deerhound/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Scottish Deerhound\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"154\",{\"href\":\"/animal/two-spot-goby/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Two-Spot Goby\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"181\",{\"href\":\"/animal/galah/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Galah\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What makes a pet name funny?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The funniest pet names usually involve puns, unexpected combinations, or references to pop culture and food. Names like 'Sir Barksalot' or 'Fuzz Aldrin' work because they play on familiar phrases in unexpected ways.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Do funny names affect how people perceive my pet?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes — and usually in a positive way! A funny name makes your pet more memorable and approachable. Vets, groomers, and fellow pet owners will smile when they hear it. It's a great conversation starter at the dog park.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can a funny dog name be too silly?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Consider where you'll use the name. You'll be calling it at the vet, in public parks, and possibly to strangers. A name that makes YOU laugh every time is perfect — just make sure you're comfortable shouting it across a field!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are the most popular funny name categories?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Food puns (Waffles, Taco), celebrity puns (Bark Wahlberg, Kitty Purry), job titles (Professor Snuggles, Doctor Woof), and ironic names (Tiny for a Great Dane, Fluffy for a hairless cat) are all consistently popular.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"dog\",{\"href\":\"/animal/dog/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐕\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Dog\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"cat\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cat/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-s